VERDICT
==============================================================================
  Every undecided residue pair tested keeps a NON-EMPTY safe set for every
  killer triple in range.  So the residue pairs are NOT obstructions: the
  COUNTING ARGUMENT was too lossy, not the geometry.  Supplier (3) is fine
  on the residue; what fails there is only the measure proof of it.

  That relocates the remaining work: a sharper argument on 456 pairs, not
  a search for a counterexample.
